## About

Software Engineer specializing in **Java Full-Stack Development**, with hands-on experience designing and building RESTful APIs, backend services, and full-stack applications using **Java, Spring Boot, React, JavaScript, Python, and PostgreSQL**.

During my Java Full-Stack internship at **KodNest Technologies**, I developed production-style backend functionality, REST APIs, authentication flows, CRUD operations, and business logic while working in a Git-based Agile environment.

I enjoy engineering products that solve real problems rather than building isolated demos. My work spans **full-stack development, AI/ML engineering, RAG pipelines, local LLM applications, real-time systems, and cloud-ready architectures**.

I have built a real-time alumni networking platform serving **1,500+ users** and secured **3rd place among 130+ teams** at the **Code Bharat Hackathon 2025** for an AI-powered email intelligence platform.

### Open To

- Software Engineering opportunities
- Java Full-Stack Developer roles
- Backend / Full-Stack Engineering
- AI/ML Engineering opportunities
- Product Engineering teams
- Open-source collaboration
- Building scalable, user-focused products

