## Featured Projects

<details>
<summary><strong>InsightMail — AI-Powered Email Intelligence Platform</strong></summary>

<br/>

An AI-powered email intelligence platform designed to reduce manual email triage by automatically understanding the intent, sentiment, urgency, and compliance risk of incoming messages.

| Category | Details |
|---|---|
| **Stack** | Python, FastAPI, React, Ollama, RAG, Embeddings |
| **Scale** | Hackathon project developed in a 16-hour build |
| **Performance** | Automated classification and context-aware analysis |
| **Security** | Local LLM execution keeps sensitive email information on-device |
| **Impact** | Faster identification and handling of high-priority emails |
| **Repository** | [GitHub](https://github.com/sanjaychavan05) |

### Engineering Highlights

- Built automated **intent, sentiment, urgency, and compliance-risk analysis**.
- Engineered a **RAG pipeline** using embeddings and vector similarity search.
- Used **local LLMs through Ollama** instead of relying exclusively on third-party APIs.
- Implemented context-aware **smart replies**.
- Designed the system around privacy-conscious AI processing.

</details>

<details>
<summary><strong>GradNet — Alumni Association Platform</strong></summary>

<br/>

A real-time alumni and student networking platform built to connect students and alumni while centralizing mentorship, job opportunities, discussions, and communication.

| Category | Details |
|---|---|
| **Stack** | React.js, Node.js, Express.js, PostgreSQL, AWS |
| **Scale** | 1,500+ users |
| **Performance** | Real-time communication and centralized community workflows |
| **Security** | Authentication-driven platform architecture |
| **Impact** | Enabled mentorship, networking and job-referral opportunities |
| **Repository** | [GitHub](https://github.com/sanjaychavan05/GradNet) |

### Engineering Highlights

- Built a full-stack platform serving **1,500+ users**.
- Centralized **job boards, discussion forums, messaging and alumni networking**.
- Replaced fragmented social-media groups and email-based communication with one platform.
- Designed the system for real-time interaction and scalable community workflows.
- Deployed cloud infrastructure using **AWS**.

</details>

<details>
<summary><strong>AI Career Verse — AI Career Readiness Platform</strong></summary>

<br/>

An AI-powered career-readiness platform providing students with on-demand resume feedback and interview practice without requiring continuous access to human mentors.

| Category | Details |
|---|---|
| **Stack** | Java, Spring Boot, React.js, WebSocket, Google Gemini API |
| **Scale** | Student-focused career platform |
| **Performance** | Instant AI-generated feedback |
| **Security** | Role-Based Access Control |
| **Impact** | Reduced dependency on scarce mentor availability |
| **Repository** | [GitHub](https://github.com/sanjaychavan05) |

### Engineering Highlights

- Built backend services using **Java and Spring Boot**.
- Implemented real-time functionality with **WebSocket**.
- Integrated the **Google Gemini API** for AI-powered career assistance.
- Added automated resume scoring and mock-interview evaluation.
- Implemented **role-based access control** for platform security.

</details>

